# Allowlist .gitignore — ignore EVERYTHING, then re-bless only the flagship.
# Forward safety net: when local-only dirs are restored alongside (Phase 8 of the
# migration), they stay physically present but impossible to commit.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/LICENSE
!/logo.png
!/CNAME
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/.github/
!/core/
!/cli/
!/protocol/
!/docs/
